        "changed_premise": "The prior revision described the backlog evidence as a local run. The same case is now retained as CheckRun 62f089bd843641099558ff8d8831ab29, so the statement and conditions cite the receipt; the substantive correction (compaction condition necessary but not sufficient) is unchanged.",
